---
---
<section class="process-section" id="proceso">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <h2>El Camino hacia tu <span class="text-gold">Empresa</span></h2>
      <p>Un proceso estructurado, transparente y ágil. Nosotros nos encargamos de la complejidad legal y burocrática del Registro Público en la jurisdicción seleccionada.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline">
      <!-- Paso 1 -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal delay-100">
        <div class="step-bg-number">01</div>
        <div class="timeline-marker">1</div>
        <div class="timeline-content glass-panel">
          <h3>Asesoramiento y Planificación</h3>
          <p>Definimos el objeto social, composición del capital y la estructura de administración ideal para tu modelo de negocio.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Paso 2 -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal delay-200">
        <div class="step-bg-number">02</div>
        <div class="timeline-marker">2</div>
        <div class="timeline-content glass-panel">
          <h3>Redacción y Firma</h3>
          <p>Confeccionamos el Instrumento Constitutivo adecuado. Coordinamos la firma mediante escribanía local con certificación de identidades.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Paso 3 -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal delay-300">
        <div class="step-bg-number">03</div>
        <div class="timeline-marker">3</div>
        <div class="timeline-content glass-panel">
          <h3>Gestión Registral</h3>
          <p>Ingresamos el expediente en el Registro Público correspondiente (IPJ Córdoba o DPJ Mendoza). Realizamos el seguimiento y contestamos vistas legales.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Paso 4 -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal delay-400">
        <div class="step-bg-number">04</div>
        <div class="timeline-marker">4</div>
        <div class="timeline-content glass-panel featured-step">
          <h3>Sociedad Constituida y CUIT</h3>
          <p>Entrega de los instrumentos inscriptos legalmente, obtención del CUIT ante AFIP y apertura de libros societarios y contables.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .process-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.02) 50%, transparent 100%);
  }
  
  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  
  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .section-header p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 24px;
    width: 2px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-left: 70px;
  }

  .step-bg-number {
    position: absolute;
    top: -20px;
    right: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(80px, 12vw, 140px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    opacity: 0.04;
    line-height: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .timeline-marker {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    z-index: 2;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
    transition: transform 0.4s ease, background-color 0.4s ease, color 0.4s ease;
  }

  .timeline-item:hover .timeline-marker {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    background: var(--accent-gold);
    color: #000;
  }

  .timeline-content {
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease, border-color 0.4s ease;
  }

  .timeline-content:hover {
    transform: translateX(10px);
    border-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
  }
  
  .featured-step {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.05) 0%, var(--glass-bg) 100%);
    border-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .featured-step h3 {
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }

  p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .timeline::before {
      left: 20px;
    }
    
    .timeline-marker {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    
    .timeline-item {
      padding-left: 60px;
    }
    
    .timeline-content {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
